# traced-checkout

Generated by CIaC: a system of 2 deployable services.
Each directory is a complete standalone crate with its own README.

| Service | Directory | Host port |
|---------|-----------|-----------|
| Payments | [`payments/`](payments/) | 8000 |
| Checkout | [`checkout/`](checkout/) | 8001 |

## Run the whole system

```sh
docker compose up --build
```

Every service's API is mapped to its host port above.
Services share one NATS broker (`queue`), so streams published by one
service are consumed by the others.

## Run one service locally

```sh
cd <service>/
cargo run
```

See each service's README for its endpoints, workers, and configuration.
